    "id": "pac_authentic_close",
    "name": "PAC (authentic close)",
    "chord_sequence": [],
    "voice_leading_hints": [],
    "contexts": [
      "The modern answer to a perfect authentic cadence. Closure comes from *arrival and cessation*",
      "not from a dominant: the bass lands on the tonic",
      "the texture stops moving",
      "and that is the close. V7-I in this idiom reads as quotation"
    ],
    "frequency_weight": 0.3,
    "emotional_color": "The modern answer to a perfect authentic cadence. Closure comes from *arrival and cessation*",
    "source_file": "stravinsky/harmonic-language.md"
